<title>USA: Cytec to buy back up to 4.5 million shares.</title>
<headline>Cytec to buy back up to 4.5 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PATERSON, N.J. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cytec Industries Inc said it will repurchase up to 4.5 million shares, or about 10 percent of company's common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>It said the repurchases will be made from time-to-time on the open market or in private transactions and will be utilized for stock option plans, benefit plans and other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The company said the new program is an extension of the previous program whereby Cytec bought back about 10 percent of its outstanding stock during the past year.</p>
</text>
